{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5001_p", "source_sha256": "b33bd89655ed4323cc600305067b6e5b66f066ee022b35242469ebc7520e5b07", "ja": "（全国の高校生たちが競い合うクイズ大会……\nそのスペシャルサポーターに茜が選ばれた）", "zh": "（全国高中生们一决高下的知识竞赛……茜被选为了那场比赛的特别支持者）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5002_023aka", "source_sha256": "48b58cc2f575ef3fb784df4ae75e12f8f533d44585f1e0f257af7bfe4a0bc3a9", "ja": "ふっふっふ。わかっているよ……茜ちゃんには！\nこのクイズ大会を通じて、やるべきことが！", "zh": "呵呵呵。我可是清楚得很……对于小茜来说！参加这场知识竞赛，要做的事情就是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5003_023aka", "source_sha256": "ebb9b8168296be8c1ed0578cb1dd461637cc07b8398fbc51ff996511e3910773", "ja": "いたいけな出演者たちに、茜ちゃんの\nかわいさをたっぷり見せつけて、ファンにするのだ～！", "zh": "要把小茜的可爱充分展现给这些惹人怜爱的出演者们，让他们成为粉丝～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5004_p", "source_sha256": "102776e9e6ef00d2e8844ef6eb2aac052f931405b9a5b95f645507fc8d7f30c3", "ja": "なんか人聞きが悪いけど……まあ、そうだな。\nひとりでも多く、ファンになって貰えたらいいな。", "zh": "总觉得这话听起来不太好……不过，确实如此。\n要是能让更多人成为粉丝就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5005_023aka", "source_sha256": "f7f6d24130603f64b4c4c961925f322aecfa0b9a5e6c9cc5e89490218ae13cdc", "ja": "ニャハハ、まかせなさーい。ではさっそくですが\n{$P$}ちゃんに問題です！", "zh": "喵哈哈，交给我吧——那么马上开始，给{$P$}出一道题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5006_023aka", "source_sha256": "8d274d6d6075cdea3e1f07c5eb6e05cf394b4abef9977972b711e70459956b31", "ja": "クイズのサポーターとして茜ちゃんに期待されてる\nのは、果たしてどんな大活躍でしょうかっ！", "zh": "作为问答的助力者，大家究竟期待小茜大显身手到什么程度呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5007", "source_sha256": "f7648f98e7c82fc0be10e828bd09e9f9c321c82bbdcf38ecfe79f89e8d81b16a", "ja": "参加者をサポートする", "zh": "为参加者提供支持", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5008", "source_sha256": "a6a2c372ef06777277fb02f31e8fa749ccb5362a45e91060fc9595e652986adf", "ja": "メチャクチャ暴れる", "zh": "大肆撒野", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5200_p", "source_sha256": "ad9bd0ad8e0da5b9a86fb1063f0519c728c838c243258eb5f042fdcc9d15f41d", "ja": "クイズ大会の主役は、参加者の高校生だからな。\n茜はあくまでサポートに徹すべきだと思うよ。", "zh": "问答大赛的主角是参赛的高中生啊。\n我觉得茜应该彻底做好辅助工作才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5201_023aka", "source_sha256": "fe54954faa8460644757cb492d4fa4ca20e234ba4ae0728e1f112ecbf96b832d", "ja": "ふむふむ。それじゃあ、みんながもっと頑張れるように\n茜ちゃんからスペシャルな賞品を提案しちゃおう。", "zh": "嗯嗯。那为了让大家更加努力，我就来提议由小茜提供特别奖品吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5202_023aka", "source_sha256": "09b912fa4b3e2bc638178906695b0aa939c0b802eedc061f0edf8102f38a961a", "ja": "特大茜ちゃん人形と、着せ替えグッズの詰め合わせ！\nくっくっく……さあ、争え！　争うのだ～！", "zh": "超大号小茜人偶，还有换装周边大礼包！  \n呵呵呵……来吧，争起来！争起来吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5300_p", "source_sha256": "ad9bd0ad8e0da5b9a86fb1063f0519c728c838c243258eb5f042fdcc9d15f41d", "ja": "クイズ大会の主役は、参加者の高校生だからな。\n茜はあくまでサポートに徹すべきだと思うよ。", "zh": "问答大赛的主角是参赛的高中生啊。\n我觉得茜应该彻底做好辅助工作才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5301_023aka", "source_sha256": "9d4ac15e1fae8a56f1f49f58dd684f02b9ffd2f09083b748e26dd27d52df3256", "ja": "ああ、正論が！　正論が耳に痛い！　たしかに主役は\nみんなのほう……だけど、茜ちゃんは自分を抑えない！", "zh": "啊，正论！正论听得我耳朵疼！主角确实应该是\n大家……但是，小茜才不会克制自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5302_023aka", "source_sha256": "f948c6e9b8c67729b9fd11cce45f9fa370ed1e52603353cf15f01701db99b50a", "ja": "サポーターとして、チラチラカメラに映り込むよ！\nあ、大丈夫大丈夫！　自然な感じにやるから！", "zh": "作为助阵人员，我会时不时在镜头里露个脸哦！\n啊，没关系没关系！我会表现得很自然的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5500_p", "source_sha256": "82e4adb0d8fabd194bfb0a1225311d8bddaa25875153ddcc6848e5c75d812085", "ja": "この仕事は、茜に来たオファーなんだ。\n茜らしさ全開で、暴れまわろう！", "zh": "这份工作是特地指名茜的通告哦。\n就全力发挥出茜的风格，大闹一场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5501_023aka", "source_sha256": "879f4cac1dfe075bdd82352191d0eaf004780eccb1ccde8a76e46d2de1ab5341", "ja": "ふっ、{$P$}ちゃん、わかってるね！\n期待に応えるのが、茜ちゃんの主義なのだ！", "zh": "哼，{$P$}，你很懂嘛！回应期待就是小茜的信条！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5502_023aka", "source_sha256": "dc8d21e07e18a78d3721026c90b52d9f3567edcd203e7899c294417baeee89f6", "ja": "茜ちゃんの全力応援ソングで、みんなの脳細胞を\n元気にしちゃうから！　みんなで優勝だ～！", "zh": "用小茜全力应援的歌曲，让大家的脑细胞都打起精神来！大家一起拿下第一～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5600_p", "source_sha256": "82e4adb0d8fabd194bfb0a1225311d8bddaa25875153ddcc6848e5c75d812085", "ja": "この仕事は、茜に来たオファーなんだ。\n茜らしさ全開で、暴れまわろう！", "zh": "这份工作是特地指名茜的通告哦。\n就全力发挥出茜的风格，大闹一场吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5601_023aka", "source_sha256": "c1e708fbacf54b62bfd679fd0fb0cb6613c36a7c2317e322318af86a835f2af2", "ja": "その言葉を待ってたよ{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃん、クイズで全問制覇を目指すから！", "zh": "{$P$}，我等的就是这句话！  \n小茜，我要争取在竞猜中全部答对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_023aka_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_023aka_5602_023aka", "source_sha256": "daf1e48601de9cf045551aff7b780e5860fa64e1e7b3078a14284c83c8c45ddb", "ja": "茜色の脳細胞が火を噴くよ！　さあ、出場者枠を\n手に入れるため、交渉に行くのだ！　レッツゴ～☆", "zh": "茜色的脑细胞要喷火啦！来，为了拿到参赛名额，出发去谈判吧！走起～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
